From: wendigoro <gorogi@tutamail.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 14:31:10 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat: movement system with stance, gait, slide, wallrun,
 dash + character animation

- Add MoveState with Stance (Stand/Crouch/Prone), Gait (Walk/Run/Sprint)
- Implement sliding (sprint + crouch tap, momentum + friction)
- Implement wallrunning (detect walls, reduced gravity, wall jump)
- Implement dashing (ground/air, C key, cooldown, invuln frames)
- Add stamina system for sprint/dash
- Procedural character voxel model with animated legs, arms, torso, head
- Per-frame mesh rebuild for animation (bob, sway, stance poses)
- New --smoke-movement flag with 300-frame test sequence
- New scripts/smoke_movement.ps1 for CI integration
- Fix launch_dev.ps1 Invoke-RepoScript to use Start-Process (avoid stdout capture bug)
- Update SmokeAll to run all three smokes (Painter + Engine + Movement)
- Update README with movement controls and architecture
