Subject: [PATCH 6/6] fix: water collision border removed

- Added isSolidForPhysics() helper: water is NEVER solid for player physics
- Updated checkGround(), checkHorizontalCollision(), ground snap to use helper
- Removed hard floor clamp that prevented going underwater
- Water now has no collision border for player movement (only projectiles hit water)
- Fixes weird clipping into floor when in water
